  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Alert 2015 - 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Alert 2015 - 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Generating self-sustaining peacebuilding processes in International Alert&apos;s target countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Alert is an international NGO active in peacebuilding, violence prevention and strengthening of human security in over 25 countries and territories. The organisation also aims to influence regional and international policy development and to advise governments, organisations and the private sector to support peace. International Alert has around 200 staff in 15 offices in the world and around 300 partner organisations. Its headquarters are located in London. The contribution is for core support 2016 &#x2013; 2018.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Alert &#xe4;r en enskild organisation med s&#xe4;te i London. Organisationen arbetar med att f&#xf6;rebygga v&#xe4;pnad konflikt och st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet i &#xf6;ver 25 l&#xe4;nder och territorier. Vidare ser organisationen som sitt uppdrag att p&#xe5; en regional och internationell niv&#xe5; f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra policyer och policyefterlevnad som &#xe4;r viktiga f&#xf6;r att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r fred samt att st&#xe4;rka andra akt&#xf6;rer att verka f&#xf6;r fred. Organisationen har ca 200 anst&#xe4;llda p&#xe5; 15 kontor runtom i v&#xe4;rlden. Vidare har Alert n&#xe4;rmare 300 partnerorganisationer. Insatsen avser k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d 2016 &#x2013; 2018.</narrative>
  </description>
